===Etymology 1===
{{ety|en|id=agreement|:bor|la:compactum<t:agreement>|text=+|tree=1}}

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# An [[agreement]] or [[contract]].
#: {{syn|en|agreement|contract|pact|treaty}}
#* {{RQ:en:New York Times|author=Peter Baker|title=Biden Seeks Shift in How the Nation Serves Its People|date=2021-04-29|url=https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/28/us/politics/joe-biden-government-plans.html|passage=President Biden laid out an ambitious agenda on Wednesday night to rewrite the American social '''compact''' by vastly expanding family leave, child care, health care, preschool and college education for millions of people to be financed with increased taxes on the wealthiest earners.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20260118010233/https://www.nytimes.com/2021/04/28/us/politics/joe-biden-government-plans.html|archivedate=18 January 2026}}
#* {{RQ:en:New York Times|author=David Yaffe-Bellany|title=The Rise of the Crypto Mayors|date=2022-01-25|url=https://www.nytimes.com/2022/01/25/business/crypto-mayors.html|passage=After taking over this month as president of the U.S. Conference of Mayors, a nonpartisan coalition of city mayors, he urged members to sign a “crypto '''compact'''” calling on the federal government to eschew overly aggressive regulation of the industry.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20260124164504/https://www.nytimes.com/2022/01/25/business/crypto-mayors.html|archivedate=24 January 2026}}
#* {{quote-web|en|author=Chandran Nair|title=Anti-China Rhetoric Is Off the Charts in Western Media|work=The Diplomat|url=https://thediplomat.com/2023/02/anti-china-rhetoric-is-off-the-charts-in-western-media/|date=21 Feb 23|text=Countering this in international media by offering more balanced views for a global audience is near impossible as censorship is rife. There almost seems to be a global '''compact''' to control the narrative, a propaganda war powered by today’s digital technology.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20260829161359/https://thediplomat.com/2023/02/anti-china-rhetoric-is-off-the-charts-in-western-media/|archivedate=29 August 2026}}

